        ex:hasText "By hosting the client's data on these green infrastructures and implementing Our digital sobriety practices, Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of the client's systems of information and lowering the client's energy consumption, aligning with the client's sustainability goals and requirements for low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

