        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposes an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents in agents daily missions, improve efficiency and quality of service, and provide intelligent assistance tools. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improve efficiency and quality of service, and provide intelligent assistance tools will be designed as a tool of assistance, ensuring explicability and transparency, and will comply with regulatory and legal constraints, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)." ;
