    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium team, comprising experienced project managers, business analysts, and technical experts, will ensure all aspects of The project are properly managed. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improve efficiency and quality of service, and provide intelligent assistance tools will integrate with existing practices and systems, including the electronic management of documents (EDM) and user directories. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improve efficiency and quality of service, and provide intelligent assistance tools will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying administrative activities such as searching for information, drafting letters or answers to users, and instructing files. an Artificial Intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents in their daily missions, improve efficiency and quality of service, and provide intelligent assistance tools will also facilitate continuity of file processing between agents and services, allowing effective resumption of processing by another agent." ;
